{'symbol': 'HAL', 'date': '2021-12-15 09:17:00', 'title': 'FREESTONE ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF GROWTH FINANCING FOR MOMENTUM TECHNOLOGIES', 'text': 'DALLAS, DEC. 15,\xa02021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FREESTONE HOLDCO, LLC ("FREESTONE"), A PORTFOLIO COMPANY OF TAILWATER CAPITAL LLC ("TAILWATER"),\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SIGNED DEFINITIVE AGREEMENTS TO LEAD A $20 MILLION INVESTMENT IN MOMENTUM TECHNOLOGIES ("MOMENTUM" OR THE "COMPANY"), A DALLAS-BASED LITHIUM-ION BATTERY AND RARE EARTH PERMANENT MAGNET RECYCLING COMPANY. FOUNDED IN 2016, MOMENTUM INSTALLS AND OPERATES RECYCLING PLANTS FOR ITS CUSTOMERS AT A WIDE RANGE OF CAPACITIES USING ITS PATENTED MODULAR, SCALABLE RECYCLING TECHNOLOGY, MEMBRANE SOLVENT EXTRACTION ("MSX").'}